<title>BELGIUM: Luxembourg Banque UCL to be called Fortis Bank.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg Banque UCL to be called Fortis Bank.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxembourg's Banque UCL SA, a unit of the Belgian-Dutch bancassurance group Fortis is to be renamed  Fortis Bank Luxembourg from January 1, 1997, a Fortis spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Banque UCL is controlled by Belgium's  ASLK-CGER bank, in which Fortis holds 49.5 percent. Fortis is itself 50/50 owned by Fortis AG and Fortis Amev NV.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
